<fieldset class="finish-picker"><legend>Make it theirs.</legend><p class="text-sm muted">Color preferences for printed covers and textile trim. Metal, wheels and suspension hardware keep their specified materials.</p><div class="finish-presets" role="group" aria-label="Printed service-part color presets"><button type="button" @click="accent.set('#254b38')" :aria-pressed="accent() === '#254b38'"><span style="background:#254b38"></span>Forest</button><button type="button" @click="accent.set('#286881')" :aria-pressed="accent() === '#286881'"><span style="background:#286881"></span>Ocean</button><button type="button" @click="accent.set('#8b3852')" :aria-pressed="accent() === '#8b3852'"><span style="background:#8b3852"></span>Berry</button><button type="button" @click="accent.set('#dfb437')" :aria-pressed="accent() === '#dfb437'"><span style="background:#dfb437"></span>Sunflower</button></div><div class="finish-inputs"><label>Custom cover color<input aria-label="Custom cover color" type="color" name="accent" form="{{ finishForm }}" value="{{ initialFinish.accent }}" x-model="accent"><output>{{ accent() }}</output></label><label>Textile trim<input aria-label="Textile trim color" type="color" name="trim" form="{{ finishForm }}" value="{{ initialFinish.trim }}" x-model="trim"><output>{{ trim() }}</output></label></div><p class="text-xs muted">Saved with your selection. Custom shades are preferences, subject to material availability, validation and final pricing. Photos keep their reference colors. Wheelchair studios show candidate textile layers. Their dimensions and materials still need fitting and validation.</p></fieldset>
